available in-app under Settings -> Open-source licences and dependencies.

The authoritative list is kOgLDependencyLicenses in
lib/surface/app/project_info.dart. It is kept in sync with pubspec.yaml and
contains only packages actually imported at runtime (development-only tools
such as flutter_lints are not shipped).

